### TESTING ROUTES
### ================ GET ROUTES ================

### Get all movies
GET http://localhost:8080/movies

### Get movie by id
GET http://localhost:8080/movies/1

### Get reviews for a movie
GET http://localhost:8080/movies/1/reviews

### Get user by id
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1

### Get reviews by user
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1/reviews

### Get watchlist by user
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1/watchlist

### Get who a user is following
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1/following

### Get a user's followers
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1/followers


### ================ POST ROUTES ================

### Register a user
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "abe",
  "email": "abe@example.com",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### Create a review for a movie
POST http://localhost:8080/movies/2/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "rating": 6
}

### Add a movie to a user's watchlist
POST http://localhost:8080/users/1/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 1
}

### Follow a user
POST http://localhost:8080/users/1/following
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "followeeId": 3
}

### Duplicate username - alice already exists -> should 409 DuplicateUsernameException
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "email": "somethingnew@example.com",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### Duplicate watchlist entry - alice already has The Dark Knight (movie 2) -> should 409 DuplicateWatchlistException
POST http://localhost:8080/users/1/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 2
}

### Self follow - alice following herself -> should 400 SelfFollowException
POST http://localhost:8080/users/1/following
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "followeeId": 1
}

### Invalid rating - out of 1-10 range -> should 400 InvalidRatingException
POST http://localhost:8080/movies/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "rating": 15
}

### Delete review - bob's review of Dark Knight (review id 4, owned by user 2)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/movies/2/reviews/4?userId=2

### Verify - should now show only alice's original review of Dark Knight
GET http://localhost:8080/movies/2/reviews


### Delete watchlist entry - alice's Inception entry (entry id 3)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/1/watchlist/3

### Verify - alice's watchlist should be back to just Dark Knight
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1/watchlist


### Delete follow - alice unfollowing abe (user 3)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/1/following/3

### Verify - alice should only be following bob again
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1/following


### Delete user - abe (user 3, throwaway test user)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/3

### Verify - should 404, user no longer exists
GET http://localhost:8080/users/3